OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M40 southbound shut after
OL,4,Afour-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the southbound carriageway of
OL,7,Fthe M40 was shut due to a four-vehicle
OL,8,Fcrash, National Highways said.
OL,10,FThe road was closed between junction 1A
OL,11,Fnear Gerrards Cross, Buckinghamshire,
OL,12,Fand junction one for the M25 link road.
OL,14,FThames Valley Police said three people
OL,15,Fsustained minor injuries in the
OL,16,Fcollision, which was first reported to
OL,17,FNational Highways at 05:45 GMT.
OL,19,FThe road reopened at about 08:20 but
OL,20,Fdrivers have been warned of heavy
OL,21,Fcongestion and long residual delays in
OL,22,Fthe area, police said.
